    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2588" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰολ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰόλλω</span>
			: metaph., <i>trick out with false words</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηδ᾽ αἰόλιζε ταῦτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					912
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Αἰολεύς</span>) <i>compose in the Aeolian
			mode</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰ. τῷ μέλει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pratin.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					5
				</span></i>
			; <i>speak Aeolic</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dicaearch.
				3.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				8.1.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cim.</u>
				1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰολίζεται τὰ Ἀλκαίου ποιήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.D.
					<u>Synt.</u>
					279.52
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀολλίζω</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Menecl.
				8
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
